    "text": "If $\\mathrm{x}_1, \\mathrm{x}_2, \\mathrm{x}_3$ and $\\mathrm{y}_1, \\mathrm{y}_2, \\mathrm{y}_3$ are both in G.P. with the same common ratio, then the points $\\left(\\mathrm{x}_1, \\mathrm{y}_1\\right),\\left(\\mathrm{x}_2, \\mathrm{y}_2\\right)$ and $\\left(\\mathrm{x}_3\\right.$, $\\mathrm{y}_3$ )",
